---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Chain Link Fence — Specs, Prices & Anping Factories" description="Galvanized and PVC coated chain link fence for sports, security, and farm. Diamond mesh sizes, wire gauges, and direct sourcing from Anping factories.">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">Chain Link Fence</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">Chain link fence — also called diamond mesh fence or cyclone fence — is woven from galvanized steel wire in a diamond pattern. Anping factories supply it for sports fields, schools, warehouses, construction sites, farms, and security perimeters worldwide.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Materials & Coatings</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Wire</th><th>Coating</th><th>Lifespan</th><th>Best For</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Electro galvanized</td><td>1.5–4.0mm</td><td>7–15 g/m² zinc</td><td>2–5 years</td><td>Temporary / indoor</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Hot-dip galvanized</td><td>2.0–5.0mm</td><td>40–60 g/m² zinc</td><td>8–15 years</td><td>Sports / security</td></tr>
          <tr><td>PVC coated</td><td>2.0–4.0mm core</td><td>Plastic over galvanized</td><td>10–20 years</td><td>Parks / schools</td></tr>
          <tr><td>PPVC (pre-coated)</td><td>2.0–4.0mm</td><td>Pre-coated before weaving</td><td>12–25 years</td><td>High-end projects</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Common specifications</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Mesh (mm)</th><th>Wire (mm)</th><th>Height (m)</th><th>Length (m)</th><th>Application</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>40×40</td><td>2.0–2.5</td><td>0.9–2.4</td><td>10–25</td><td>Residential / garden</td></tr>
          <tr><td>50×50</td><td>2.5–3.0</td><td>1.2–3.0</td><td>10–25</td><td>Sports field / school</td></tr>
          <tr><td>55×55</td><td>2.5–3.5</td><td>1.2–3.6</td><td>10–25</td><td>Standard security</td></tr>
          <tr><td>60×60</td><td>3.0–4.0</td><td>1.5–4.0</td><td>10–25</td><td>Industrial / warehouse</td></tr>
          <tr><td>75×75</td><td>3.0–5.0</td><td>1.8–4.5</td><td>10–25</td><td>Highway / farm</td></tr>
          <tr><td>100×100</td><td>3.5–5.0</td><td>2.0–5.0</td><td>10–25</td><td>Heavy perimeter</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">Chain link is sold by roll (usually 10–25m) or by square meter. <a href="/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">Estimate weight →</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">What to specify when ordering</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Mesh opening in mm (diamond size)</li>
        <li>Wire diameter and coating type</li>
        <li>Roll height and length</li>
        <li>With or without posts, fittings, and tension wire</li>
        <li>Color if PVC coated (green, black, blue are standard)</li>
        <li>Total quantity in m² or rolls</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Price reference</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Product</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Spec</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Price Range (USD/m²)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">Lead Time</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Electro galvanized chain link</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 2.5mm wire, 1.8m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3.5–6.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Hot-dip galvanized chain link</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 3.0mm wire, 1.8m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$5.0–8.5/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">12–18 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">PVC coated chain link (green)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 3.0mm core, 1.8m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$6.5–11.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Heavy security chain link</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">60×60mm, 4.0mm wire, 2.4m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8.0–14.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">300 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">18–25 days</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">Sports field chain link</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm, 3.0mm wire, 4.0m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$7.0–12.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1000 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 days</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*Indicative 2025–2026 ranges. Actual pricing depends on zinc coating weight, wire cost, order volume, and accessories. Always request formal quotes.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">FAQ</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What's the standard chain link fence height?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Residential: 1.2–1.8m. Sports fields: 3.0–4.0m. Industrial security: 2.4–3.6m. Highways and heavy perimeter: 3.0–5.0m. Custom heights up to 6m are possible with heavier wire.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Galvanized vs PVC coated — which is better?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Hot-dip galvanized is the standard for durability and cost. PVC coated adds aesthetics and extra corrosion protection, but costs 30–50% more. For coastal or high-humidity areas, choose PVC coated or Galfan wire. For temporary construction fencing, electro galvanized is sufficient.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Do I need posts and fittings?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Yes — chain link fabric needs terminal posts, line posts, top rail, tension wire, and fittings to install. Most Anping factories supply complete systems including posts and accessories. Specify post diameter, wall thickness, and whether posts are hot-dip galvanized or painted.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">What mesh opening for security vs sports?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Security: 50×50mm or 60×60mm with 3.0mm+ wire prevents climbing and cutting. Sports: 50×50mm is standard for ball containment. Farm: 75×75mm or 100×100mm with heavier wire for animal containment.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">Can I get chain link with barbed wire on top?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Yes — many factories supply chain link with barbed wire extensions or razor wire brackets for high-security applications. Specify barbed wire type (single or double strand) and blade type if razor wire.</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">How do I calculate total project cost?</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">Calculate fence area (length × height) for fabric cost. Add posts every 2.5–3m, top rail, tension wire, gates, and fittings. Use our <a href="/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">FOB price calculator</a> to estimate landed cost.</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Get quotes from Anping chain link fence factories</p>
        <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Send an inquiry →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK TOOLS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Calculate & Convert</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Weight Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Container Loading Calc
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB Price Calculator
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/tools/inquiry-template-generator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Inquiry Template Gen
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">QUICK SPECS</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Chain Link Standards</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Mesh Opening</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">40–100 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Wire Diameter</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1.5–5.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Roll Height</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.9–5.0 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Roll Length</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">10–25 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Coating</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">Electro / HDG / PVC / PPVC</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">Standards</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM A392<br/>ISO 7987</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">RELATED</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">Related Products</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/products/wire-mesh-fence-panels/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Fence Panels
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/hexagonal-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Hexagonal Wire Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> Welded Wire Mesh
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>